{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-7","storyName":"永恒绚烂的藏品","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"留恋于梦境的祥子与家人共度了一段快乐的时光。祥子与“母亲”在田野间漫步叙旧时，遇见了红豆一行人。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["母亲","丰川祥子","父亲","？？？","红豆","爱丽丝","贝娜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5b/Avg_bg_65_g6_sakikopianoroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_piano_start","volume":"1","id":6},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":11},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_victorianormal_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":12,"musicid":0},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"祥子的琴弹得越来越好了啊~","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"有、有吗？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"祥子的变化，我当然清楚，我可是你的妈妈呀。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我能听出来，祥子一直都很努力，即使在外辛苦工作，对于钢琴的练习也从未松懈过。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"感觉祥子在外面经历了很多呢……","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"charslot","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"虽然很不想打扰你们练琴，但饭已经做好咯？","id":28},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_65_g5_sakikodininghall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dishes","volume":"1","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔——好吃！","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"怎么样，我手艺又长进了吧？","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"你是不知道……他逼我尝了多少次，才有了现在这个味道。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","volume":"1","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"这盘沙拉，快试试怎么样？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔，很好吃！","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"为了祥子能喜欢，我做了很多细微的调整哦！还不赖吧。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"还有很多别的祥子喜欢的菜哦！","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#11$2","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"嗯！","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"charslot","id":60},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_65_g5_sakikodininghall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"50","duration":"0.4","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"呃……呃……","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"祥子？祥子！","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1940_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"父亲","text":"怎、怎么了？","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_npc_1940_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不知不觉，吃得有点多……","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"charslot","id":78},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_bg_31_g3_mini12_farmland.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":80},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":81,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"现在好点了吗……？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"真是的，你爸爸就是这样的……","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"不过这就是他的行事风格，大多数时候也挺可爱的。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"祥子，你会原谅他的吧？","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我……","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"charslot","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我……真的能原谅他吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":96},{"type":"subtitle","text":"那个和他有着相同面貌的男人，曾无数次地伤透我的心。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":97},{"type":"subtitle","id":98},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"他真的很爱你哦。","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"——！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我也一样。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"我真的很爱你们。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"妈妈，怎么突然这么说……","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"你出远门的这段时间，我开始越来越频繁地翻相册了。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"从你出生时的照片，翻到一岁、两岁、三岁……","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"在父母的眼中，孩子永远是最重要、最特殊的存在哦。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"你刚出生的时候，手掌只有我的一半不到。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"但现在你看，已经比我的要大一点点啦。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"charslot","id":118},{"type":"text","text":"母亲拉起祥子的手，将两人的掌心慢慢对齐。","id":119},{"type":"text","text":"不知为何，祥子用五指紧紧地扣住了妈妈的手。","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"妈妈，你的手好暖和……","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这就是妈妈手心的温度吗……","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":126},{"type":"subtitle","text":"这一切，是真实的吗？我享受的这一切，是合理的吗？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":127},{"type":"subtitle","text":"为什么会如此温暖，却又如此哀伤？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":128},{"type":"subtitle","id":129},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"嗯，我在哦。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"妈妈……","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"哭鼻子也没关系哦。你以前哭鼻子的时候，我也是这么安慰你的。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"欸……我以前有那么爱哭鼻子吗？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"在你很小很小的时候吧，那时祥子经常为了一颗糖又哭又闹呢。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"虽然祥子现在是个坚强的孩子，但那时真的是个爱哭包呀。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"是、是吗，我一点都不记得了……","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"哈哈哈哈哈，妈妈可不会骗你哦。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"那……妈妈，你还记得我的高中入学典礼吗？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"subtitle","text":"初三的那年，母亲因病急逝。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":155},{"type":"subtitle","text":"未曾留痕的记忆，或者从未发生的事情。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":156},{"type":"subtitle","text":"此刻却想要最美好的答案。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":157},{"type":"subtitle","text":"说服自己，创造最美好的回忆，相信最美好的梦境。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":158},{"type":"subtitle","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"当然啦。我还记得那天你穿着校服，我们一家还在校门前合影呢。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"好像是呢……真让人怀念啊。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我们以前，还经历过哪些事？妈妈……我想听你讲，关于我们的回忆。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"祥子，你是不是离开家里太久啦？怎么今天这么黏人？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"家……","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"subtitle","text":"“家”这个名词，是从什么时候开始，变得这么陌生的呢？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":175},{"type":"subtitle","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"嗯……既然你想听，那我就再回忆回忆吧。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"从什么时候开始讲起呢？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"从我出生的时候开始吧，我想一直听下去。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1941_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"母亲","text":"好，那就从你的出生开始讲起吧……","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"就这样，在田间小路上，母女二人肩并着肩，以不快不慢的速度走着，仿佛可以一直这样走下去。","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"就像她们最开始的那段美好时光一样，不慌不忙，没有戛然而止。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"她们的手，就像最开始连接两人的那根脐带。","id":191},{"type":"dialog","id":192},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"祥子——","id":195},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_enginerun","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"bse","id":198},{"type":"soundvolume","channel":"bse","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2.5","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"你找到回家的路了呀！","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"红豆小姐，这台车好像有故障，快放我下来！","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"我看看……怎、怎么和在罗德岛上学的操作方法不一样啊？！","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"红豆","text":"不行不行，要停不下来了！","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爱丽丝","text":"要撞上了——","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝娜","text":"祥子，你们快闪开——！","id":206},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bse","fadetime":"2","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"image","id":211},{"type":"charslot","id":212}],"characters":["母亲","丰川祥子","父亲","？？？","红豆","爱丽丝","贝娜"]}